  is_views_04   | is_views_04_schema | hash_partition_table  | p_hash_1       | NULL              | 2                          | NULL                          | HASH             | NULL                | bucket               | NULL                    | (1)
  is_views_04   | is_views_04_schema | list_partition_table  | p_east         | NULL              | 1                          | NULL                          | LIST             | NULL                | region               | NULL                    | (1)
  is_views_04   | is_views_04_schema | list_partition_table  | p_west         | NULL              | 2                          | NULL                          | LIST             | NULL                | region               | NULL                    | (2)
  is_views_04   | is_views_04_schema | range_partition_table | p_low          | NULL              | 1                          | NULL                          | RANGE            | NULL                | id                   | NULL                    | (1) TO (10)
  is_views_04   | is_views_04_schema | range_partition_table | p_high         | NULL              | 2                          | NULL                          | RANGE            | NULL                | id                   | NULL                    | (10) TO (20)
